{
  "bodyHash": "i6QGi5pvLZY=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/6b5b7494-e8ae-4193-b7f7-3638f4c30fc0\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#800000;font-size:14px\"><strong>《约翰模组：重生》是一款恐怖模组，灵感源自2011年的Minecraft模组《约翰模组》、2012年重制版以及2020年的重制版本。本模组旨在以现代风格重塑约翰的形象，新增物品、纹理和可探索生物，同时保留原版模组的诡异氛围并加以拓展。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Minecraft最可怕的生物回来了！</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">关于模组、方块、物品与生物的详细资讯，请参阅官方Github&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基页面</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">任何问题请提交至<a href=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github问题追踪系统</a></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">点击加入我们的模组开发Discord！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/twwMj3UrPc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/855896/description_3f486133-8e3b-48c4-b6d6-9867b17b34f6.gif\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>其他模组获取管道</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/a5812dde-c7a5-4242-a2cc-c6df7087a6a6\" width=\"543\" height=\"302\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可于&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmod%252fthe-john-mod-reborn%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a>获取</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">亦可于<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjohn_mod_reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>获取</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px\"><strong>请勿二次上传本模组！</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px\"><strong>虽然这阻止不了某些人这么做……</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px\"><strong>但模组唯一官方发布管道已列于上方！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><strong>请</strong></span><span style=\"color:#800000\"><strong>谨慎选择下载来源，切勿信任9Minecraft等网站。</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;影片与评测</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VKfWdKjhKt0?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ErDD7w_6U3E?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XzAi2eDrgkw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>-特色内容：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/780323313922736148/1105774761231007845/Seperator_Mobs.png\" width=\"5\" height=\"5\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>约翰</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/15fca783-c0d2-40d2-a8ab-5d39aa725d82\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>其他图像、资讯与影片</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/ed0ba2ee-b67d-4925-93f0-948460170260\" width=\"896\" height=\"640\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/10a6d574-3fc7-4ae4-81d8-e7470ca2ea6d\" width=\"500\" height=\"358\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/8fe853f0-c3a5-4158-bafb-3f19f6fbd1a6\" width=\"500\" height=\"357\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/df11b2c6-8566-4292-8a53-707a096983d4\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"357\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>哭泣约翰实机影片</p>\n<p><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XySw4GXV5iY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">约翰（</strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>原初型</strong></span><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">）</strong></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-一种被俗称为「约翰」的稀有生物，其起源完全未知。据现有资料显示，极少有目击者生还。其皮肤异常苍白且薄如蝉翼，拥有两张嘴——分别位于躯干与头部。这个人形生物以撕裂猎物并同时吞噬残骸著称，面部呈现哭泣男子的扭曲表情，不断发出刺耳哭嚎，空洞的眼窝持续流淌血泪。它以恐惧为食，常在攻击前戏弄猎物，具有迅捷、强悍、高效且残暴的特性。切勿靠近。&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/wiki/The-John\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多资讯详见维基</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>冲刺约翰</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-与普通变种同样危险，外形几乎相同，区别在于其名称暗示的特性。此变种会在发现猎物的瞬间发动冲锋，对狩猎展现出特殊偏好，似乎享受追逐过程。其速度极快，人类无法逃脱。若被发现，只能躲藏并祈祷不被找到。注意它们智力有限易被迷惑，必要时可利用此特性。切勿靠近。&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/wiki/The-John\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多资讯详见维基</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>拥抱约翰</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-有理论认为此变种与其他变种源自被其他约翰猎杀后的受折磨灵魂残骸，这解释了它们试图通过「拥抱」动作抓住残存人性的行为（虽未经证实）。它们持续张开双臂作欢迎状，但切勿受骗。若被其抓住绝无生还可能。只要保持距离即可安全，无论如何切勿靠近。&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/wiki/The-John\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多资讯详见维基</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>哭泣约翰</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-与上述拥抱约翰类似，有理论认为此变种源自受折磨灵魂残骸。不同之处在于它们已放弃所有希望，完全屈服于恐怖形态。其哭泣频率高于其他变种，可能试图利用同情心引诱猎物。但切勿上当——一旦移开视线就会遭到攻击。它们在目标不看时极其危险。若遭遇，需持续注视、保持静默且绝对不能眨眼。遵循此方法可消灭该变种。切勿逃跑，严格按指示行动。&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/wiki/The-John\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多资讯详见维基</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>幼年约翰</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/b7ddd737-a334-485c-ac1a-e69feabae68c\" width=\"2840\" height=\"1598\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>其他图像、资讯与影片</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/e7d87a8b-79b2-42d0-b597-4d0390924e66\" width=\"630\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>群体行为实机影片</strong></p>\n<p><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/18MbdbHv0bc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"363\" height=\"363\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span>开发中的群体行为演示</p>\n<p>注意约翰如何引诱铁傀儡至同类处实施群体攻击。最后若只剩一只幼年约翰，它会试图逃离现场。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此类幼体是前述变种的未成年形态，尚未发展特殊「技能」，但成群出现时仍具威胁性。它们以最多15只的群体出现，速度远超多数成年变种，但相对脆弱。与多数生物相反，其声调随成长由低沉转为高亢，尖叫传不远。尽管处于幼年期仍具敌意。切勿靠近。&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/wiki/The-Baby-John\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多资讯详见维基</a>&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>月光效应</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/8b995c97-50f4-4a41-be8c-f239c3ca566a\" alt=\"\" width=\"208\" height=\"154\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">满月时约翰与幼年约翰有50%几率获得力量或速度强化。但因首夜必为满月，为玩家体验考量，此效果将在首夜7天后的第二次满月生效。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">另有其他受月光影响的生物</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>被猎杀者</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/1d191b0b-344b-4c3c-aa7d-a7da64620529\" width=\"630\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">其出现时可闻遥远哭嚎声。未知其出现原因，仅在满月前的盈凸月相现身。所有生物都会驱赶它，但无人在意其存在。它仿佛虚无之物，被迫游荡至次日，直至满月升起时巨型约翰现身。&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/wiki/The-Hunted\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多资讯详见维基</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-该角色尚有更多计划内容。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>巨型约翰</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/db1143b9-074c-466e-a6b2-291bb33e8937\" width=\"870\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>其他图像、资讯与影片</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/522dbad2-7458-4e60-aefe-416cd516d819\" width=\"630\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>被猎杀者转化为巨型约翰影片</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_SjdtweR1dA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">满月时被猎杀者会产生异变——一道类似闪电的能量击中它，使其蜕变为高达15米的巨型约翰。其体型超越森林树木，视野范围200米，尖啸声可传至500米外。若遭遇请立即逃跑躲藏并等待，它将在后续三个月相周期消失。因其为目击过最恐怖的存在。&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/wiki/The-Mega-John\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多资讯详见维基</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>怀念旧版纹理？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/1b8fc784-8856-441c-ae62-d621e2266b1b\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可通过以下资源包恢复所有约翰的原始纹理！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/the-john-mod-reborn-original-john-textures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">Curse<p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/4da7ee13-0fd2-4591-81a6-f7400ac623d4\" width=\"1000\" height=\"105\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/3bdc4ad8-e704-4d75-b965-2960c7149217\" width=\"735\" height=\"294\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>-不朽寶石</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有20%機率從普通John身上掉落</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">主要用於合成</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>-解放之靈</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">右鍵點擊釋放靈魂，將獎勵經驗值</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有時會從幼年John身上掉落</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>-血淚</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">從巨型John身上100%掉落</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>-John之紗（製作中）</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">右鍵點擊時會給予50格範圍內所有John發光效果</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要血淚、解放之靈、金錠、書和墨囊來合成</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/2bc2199d-02ae-46e4-b90b-7e2c761551fa\" width=\"374\" height=\"190\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>-不朽藥水</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/073ea712-5d1d-4f08-a157-2daf135bf7c1\" width=\"803\" height=\"737\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由血淚和粗製藥水合成，是一種強效藥水，提供1分20秒的力量II、速度1分20秒、抗性II 1分20秒，但會有短時間的中毒II和噁心II副作用。</span><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>-不朽之劍</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/6110fea7-eee7-4eb7-b343-2959abf3bd85\" alt=\"\" width=\"374\" height=\"190\"></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附有John剋星附魔</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">擊中時會點燃生物和火焰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">造成8點攻擊傷害</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">對所有John造成額外傷害（且與鋒利附魔疊加）：對任何John造成9-10點攻擊傷害，對巨型John造成35點攻擊傷害，只需12擊即可擊殺</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有2143次使用次數/攻擊耐久度</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">用2個不朽寶石和1根木棍合成</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>-永恆之刃</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/c380aeaa-ffa2-40ae-ad89-6f8f486507f7\" width=\"522\" height=\"270\"></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附有John剋星II附魔</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">擁有無限耐久度</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">免疫火焰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">9點攻擊傷害</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在鍛造台中與John之紗結合獲得此劍</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">對所有John造成更多額外傷害！對任何John造成9-12點攻擊傷害，對巨型John造成44點攻擊傷害，只需9擊即可擊殺。同樣與鋒利附魔疊加！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">永恆之刃的紋理靈感來自<span style=\"color:#396\">泰拉瑞亞</span>中的星怒劍</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/fd9ecd37-4b88-4336-8b62-6eaa3c14a36d\" width=\"417\" height=\"334\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">合成配方預計會更改！&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>John之桌</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.discordapp.com%252fattachments%252f780323313922736148%252f1103061729845444618%252f2023-05-02_15.50.51.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/a884e50e-fcaf-4595-bdef-c0040d26fb9e\" width=\"833\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">仍在開發中！</span></p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>新音樂！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2JxL0uihGqA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"374\" height=\"374\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@damensmusic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Damen's Music</a>製作</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>配置</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/05097739-2f14-4d1f-94b7-4e5cc997008e\" width=\"742\" height=\"562\"></p>\n<p>我們在\".minecraft\\config\"資料夾中添加了一個名為\"john_reborn_spawning.json\"的配置文件來調整生成設定</p>\n<p>建議在修改任何內容前先查看Github上的<a href=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/wiki/Config-File\" rel=\"nofollow\">配置維基</a></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>製作此模組：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px\">這個模組從年初開始開發。最初只是打算移植到遊戲的新版本。但我想為這個模組加入我們自己的特色，更新紋理並添加新物品。</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>我10歲時看了SkyDoesMinecraft的影片並非常喜歡。那時我太笨了，不知道如何在1.2版本下載模組，所以從未成功下載過，哈哈。但在2020年，當我得知有重製版時，有機會玩了這個模組。<br>年初，我想和朋友一起進行1.18模組生存遊玩。知道John模組無法加入讓我感到很遺憾。因此，我決定投入一些時間開發新版本。令人滿意的是，結果非常出色，我對John模組的未來充滿期待。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我不得不使用Blockbench完全重新創建模型。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/06ca31fe-b756-4286-9608-b5d319451b10\" width=\"446\" height=\"234\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我使用<span style=\"color:#396\"><strong>MCreator</strong></span>製作這個模組。在有人大驚小怪之前，我要說明我不是專業模組製作者。這只是一個副項目，如果你想關注優秀的開發團隊，我建議看看Aether團隊，因為他們很厲害。或者看看製作這個模組的最後三個人：Notvirgen、SCMowns，當然還有Kurtss。沒有他，我們就不會有今天：）。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我得到了Discord成員和朋友們的驚人幫助，他們都幫助我製作了這個模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/123bf881-f3e6-4c03-b1a9-a900d0838ada\" width=\"801\" height=\"663\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Legodamen/The-John-Mod-Reborn/assets/69095414/65df77ef-7a83-4bbd-81cb-ffd70bb3fbb0\" width=\"586\" height=\"368\"></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>致謝：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">當然，這一切都離不不了Kurtss在beta 1.8版本的原版模組</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1277648-1-8-1-john-v1-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft論壇頁面</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">SCMowns 2012年的重製版。他也允許我發布這個模組。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmod%252f125-john-v10-reborned---working-on-version-2%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft頁面</a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1283649-1-6-4-smp-john-v3-2-revived-mega-giant-john-baby\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft論壇頁面</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以及Notvirgen的John模組復活版</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/john-mod-resurrected\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curse forge頁面</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">紋理也受到了Pixperfect 2022年John歸來材質包的影響</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fthe-return-of-john-1-19-warden-replacement-pixperfect%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft鏈接</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>軟體</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模型使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.blockbench.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">Blockbench</span></strong></a>製作</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">「編程」使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#396\"><strong>MCreator</strong></span></a>完成</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特別感謝</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Legodamen（主要開發者）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">BlueBowTie（協助文案撰寫）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以及我Discord中提供額外想法和支持的其他人</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FinchyMcFinch</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">CollinTheBard</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Whiteboard</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Nibroc</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">SenatorSeatBelt</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Damen's Music（委託製作音樂）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">當然還有Notvirgen、SCMowns和Kurtss！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你好奇，我在任何截圖中使用的光影是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/complementary-shaders\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Complementary Shaders v4.2.2</a></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>未來計劃與更新：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目前，製作此模組的人有其他人生計劃，無法保證頻繁更新。但只要Mcreator繼續更新，他會很樂意保持模組的最新狀態。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">但我們仍有計劃</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">例如</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-修復遊戲中的音樂唱片。轉換為單聲道損壞了音質。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-也許添加一個非常稀有的John？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-一個結構？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-更改永恆之刃的合成配方。這可能包括完成John之桌。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-還想讓不朽寶石更有用，這樣它們不會在你的物品欄中堆積</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\">還應該說明，所有未來更新將在最新的可用版本上進行</span></strong></span></p>\n</",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
